          <h2 class="font-bold text-xl text-brand-text mb-3">1. GENERAL INFORMATION.</h2>
          <p class="mb-3">This legal notice outlines the general conditions governing access to and use of the website https://www.hotelplazasanantonio.com.pe (hereinafter, "the Website").</p>
