          <p class="mb-3">S&G solely acts as an intermediary between the hotel establishment and the user, transmitting reservation details to the hotel and sending the user a confirmation email on behalf of the reserved property, complying during this information exchange with applicable laws regarding data protection and privacy.</p>
          <p class="mb-3">Furthermore, through acceptance of the reservation, the client consents to the processing of their credit card data for the purpose of formalizing the booking, as well as holding said information as security deposit for potential damages and extra expenses.</p>
