            <li>Both access to the Website and use of the information contained therein are the sole responsibility of the user.</li>
            <li>Sending unsolicited bulk email or unsolicited commercial communication (SPAM) addressed to email accounts used on this website is strictly prohibited.</li>
            <li>Using this website for commercial purposes or in any manner inconsistent with its intended purpose is prohibited.</li>
