          <p class="mb-3">The property is obligated to maintain current room availability and tariff schedules. However, should overbooking or pricing maintenance errors occur, the hotel will promptly notify the user to cancel the reservation and issue a full refund (if payment occurred), assisting in identifying suitable alternative accommodations.</p>
