          <p class="mb-3">Cancellation policies are defined directly by the property via management tools allowing tailored conditions across distinct date ranges or tariff types.</p>
          <p>Please follow instructions provided in your confirmation email should you need to cancel or modify your stay. We advise carefully checking room cancellation terms. Cancelling within permitted policy guidelines ensures no charges occur; late cancellations or failing to arrive (No Show) may result in fee penalties generally equivalent to the first night's stay.</p>
